{"authority": "confirmed", "event_id": "EV-0001", "id": "MFACT-0001", "kind": "lore.milestone", "lore_ids": ["LORE-0001"], "period": null, "source_system": null, "subject": "CO-0001", "supersedes": null, "text_value": "The product hierarchy was remapped for a new category structure. The mapping between the legacy and new hierarchy has been maintained manually ever since, rather than being migrated into the merchandising master.", "valid_from": "2024-08-01T00:00:00Z", "valid_to": null, "value": null}
{"authority": "confirmed", "event_id": "EV-0002", "id": "MFACT-0002", "kind": "lore.milestone", "lore_ids": ["LORE-0002"], "period": null, "source_system": null, "subject": "CO-0001", "supersedes": null, "text_value": "No team owns the legacy-to-new hierarchy mapping table. Merchandising believes the data platform owns it because it is consumed there; the data platform believes Merchandising owns it because it is master data.", "valid_from": "2024-11-01T00:00:00Z", "valid_to": null, "value": null}
{"authority": "confirmed", "event_id": "EV-0003", "id": "MFACT-0003", "kind": "lore.milestone", "lore_ids": ["LORE-0003"], "period": null, "source_system": null, "subject": "CO-0001", "supersedes": null, "text_value": "Month-end close is expected to complete within four business days of period end. Overruns are escalated to the Group CFO the same day.", "valid_from": "2022-01-01T00:00:00Z", "valid_to": null, "value": null}
{"authority": "confirmed", "event_id": "EV-0004", "id": "MFACT-0004", "kind": "lore.milestone", "lore_ids": ["LORE-0004"], "period": null, "source_system": null, "subject": "CO-0001", "supersedes": null, "text_value": "The checkout and loyalty stack was replatformed. Conversion has been volatile since, and forecasting for the online unit has not been re-baselined against post-replatform behaviour.", "valid_from": "2025-09-01T00:00:00Z", "valid_to": null, "value": null}
{"authority": "confirmed", "event_id": "EV-0005", "id": "MFACT-0005", "kind": "lore.milestone", "lore_ids": ["LORE-0005"], "period": null, "source_system": null, "subject": "CO-0001", "supersedes": null, "text_value": "General Merchandise defends margin performance by pointing to promotional depth agreed with Food for joint campaigns. Food regards those campaigns as General Merchandise's commercial choice.", "valid_from": "2025-02-01T00:00:00Z", "valid_to": null, "value": null}
